 ("03-soft-saas", "Soft SaaS", """The look of Notion or Stripe's dashboard, friendly for people who are not technical. Warm off-white (light) or warm charcoal (dark), 12 px rounded cards with soft shadows, pastel pills, a humanist sans at 15 px, airy spacing. Layout: the pulse as a soft banner; the chat as the wide centre column, the main region, with a big rounded composer; the board as a shelf of five short columns across the bottom."""),
