 ("05-broadsheet", "Broadsheet", """A newspaper front page as a tool. Serif headlines (Times-like), a serif text face, small capitals as section heads, hairline column rules, the pulse as the day's headline across the top, the status figures as a dateline. Cards are news briefs: a bold title, one line of body. Layout: the board as four newspaper columns on the left, the chat as the wide right column, the main region, with the composer as a rule-boxed field at the bottom. Light is cream paper with black ink; dark is the night edition, ink black with ivory text."""),
