 ("07-trading-floor", "Trading floor", """A Bloomberg terminal. Black, amber and orange text, small dense type, tabular numerals, every card as one table row with columns for the number, the title, the state, the time and the spend, the five columns as five short tables stacked. A ticker of events along the bottom. The chat as the message pane on the right third with a command line at its bottom. The pulse as the first amber line. Dark only in spirit; the light version is a pale amber on cream terminal."""),
 ("08-grafana-dense", "Grafana dense", """An observability dashboard. Graphite panels with 1 px borders, teal as the accent, 12 px sans, tabular numerals. The status figures as a KPI row with small sparklines (spend over the month, cards done per day). The pulse as a one-line alert bar under the KPIs. Layout: the board as five compact columns of tiles on the left two thirds; the chat on the right third with the composer at the bottom. Dense and exact."""),
 ("09-inbox-first", "Inbox first", """An email client. Layout: Needs you as an inbox list on the left (two rows: "Merge PR #612" with its recommendation as the preview line, "#603 Which store for the session table?" with its choices as small buttons), the chat as the centre reading pane, the main region, with the composer at its bottom, and the board collapsed into a progress strip across the top (five segments "Queued 4", "Working 3", "Verifying 2", "Done 8" with the running cards' titles as small text). The pulse as a thin banner above the strip. Neutral calm palette, 14 px sans, hairlines."""),
 ("10-command-palette", "Command palette", """Raycast. A centred command bar at the top holds the chat's message box, large, with a blurred backdrop; the agent's reply and the proposal float as a sheet directly under it. The board below as dense tiles in five columns. Graphite with one violet accent, 8 px radii, subtle inner shadows, 13 px sans. The pulse as a thin line above the command bar. Keyboard hints as small key caps."""),
 ("11-terminal", "Terminal brutalist", """A terminal. Monospace for everything, box-drawing borders (┌ ─ ┐ │ └ ┘) around every panel, no rounded corners, no shadows. Dark: phosphor amber on black. Light: dark ink on paper-tape cream. The pulse as the first line. The board as five bordered boxes in a row, each card a few monospace lines. The chat as a REPL across the bottom with a "> " prompt as the composer and the last exchange above it. The two Needs you items with their buttons as bracketed [Approve as you] [Deny]."""),
 ("12-blueprint", "Blueprint", """An engineering blueprint. Grid paper background, thin lines, cards as schematic blocks with a title bar, labels in a mono typeface, dimension marks, the flow between the five columns drawn as wires with arrowheads. Dark: cyan lines on deep navy. Light: blue lines on cream. The pulse as a title block in the top left corner. The chat as the "notes" panel on the right with the composer as a labelled field."""),
